OL,3,ACanada says it will match US tariffs
OL,4,A'dollar for dollar' as trade talks
OL,5,Abreak down
OL,6,
OL,7,FA fresh wave of US tariffs on a wide
OL,8,Farray of Canadian goods came into
OL,9,Feffect on Saturday after a last-minute
OL,10,Fbreakdown in trade talks.
OL,12,FAnnouncing the suspension of
OL,13,Fnegotiations shortly before the Friday
OL,14,Fnight deadline, Canadian Prime Minister
OL,15,FMark Carney said he would impose
OL,16,Freciprocal tariffs on US goods "dollar
OL,17,Ffor dollar".
OL,19,FCarney said "last-minute changes in the
OL,20,FUS proposed terms were unfair,
OL,21,Funeconomic, and called into question
OL,22,Fthe reliability of any deal".
OL,23,APub: 22-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
