OL,3,ACanada says it will match US tariffs
OL,4,A'dollar for dollar' as trade talks
OL,5,Abreak down
OL,6,
OL,7,FTrade negotiators had been engaged in
OL,8,Fintense talks since July, after
OL,9,FPresident Donald Trump threatened to
OL,10,Fimpose a 50% levy on nearly $20bn
OL,11,F(C$28bn; #14bn) of Canadian imports by
OL,12,F19 August.
OL,23,APub: 22-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
